OL,4,BMuch still to do on F1 diversity -     
OL,5,BHamilton                               
OL,6,GLewis Hamilton says there is "much     
OL,7,Gstill to do" when it comes to          
OL,8,Gincreasing diversity in Formula 1.     
OL,10,FThe seven-time champion has used a     
OL,11,Freport published on the five-year      
OL,12,Fanniversary of establishing his        
OL,13,FMission 44 charity to demand three key 
OL,14,Fsteps from the sport.                  
OL,16,FThe campaign seeks to increase the     
OL,17,Frepresentation of black people, women  
OL,18,Fand people from lower socio-economic   
OL,19,Fbackgrounds in F1.                     
